## 6. Add the debug screen to navigation

In your existing `VaultNavHost.kt`, add a debug route (gated by
`BuildConfig.DEBUG`):

```kotlin
if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) {
    composable("debug_agent") {
        DebugAgentScreen()
    }
}
```

Add a button somewhere (Settings screen is a natural place) to navigate there:

```kotlin
if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) {
    OutlinedButton(onClick = { navController.navigate("debug_agent") }) {
        Text("Agent debug harness")
    }
}
```

