## 7. First run — end-to-end

1. Install the app.
2. Open **Settings → Accessibility → Amar Vault Agent → On**.
3. Return to the app, navigate to the debug screen.
4. The status chip at the top should go green ("Accessibility service: CONNECTED").
5. Tap **Open WhatsApp**.

Expected trace (success path):

```
[submit] {...}
[accepted] task=task-a1b2c3d4
  Pending
  Running attempt=1
  Verifying (exec took 24ms)
✓ Succeeded attempts=1 duration=847ms result={package=com.whatsapp}
```

