## 8. Troubleshooting cheat sheet

| Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| Status chip stays red | User hasn't enabled the service | Settings → Accessibility |
| "Open Settings" succeeds but "Open WhatsApp" fails immediately | WhatsApp not installed (or different package on ROM) | Try the explicit `packageId` override in the envelope |
| Click succeeds per executor but verify times out | UI change hasn't propagated in 1.5s | Increase `timeout_ms` or add a `wait` step before verify |
| Task hangs, never reaches terminal | Coroutine leak or AccessibilityService unbinding mid-walk | Force-stop app; check logcat for `TreeWalker threw` |
| Checkpoints not persisting | Room init failed | Check logcat for `CheckpointWriter` tag — migration or schema issue |

