## 9. What's NOT included yet

- **LiteRT integration** — deferred per your build-order decision.
- **Intent cache** (spec §5) — bypass LLM for common commands. Premature until
  LiteRT is integrated and we have real TTFT measurements.
- **Memory system** (spec §6) — phase 2.
- **Shadow Brain hooks** (spec §7) — phase 3, also the migration path for the
  existing llama.cpp integration from Amar Vault.
- **Clipboard paste fallback** for TypeText — some Flutter/Compose custom
  inputs reject ACTION_SET_TEXT. Adding when a real failing case demands it.
- **SendMessageUiExecutor** — Accessibility-tier fallback for `send_message`
  when deep links don't work (e.g., Signal, Messenger, phone-number Telegram).
  The Brain can compose this from open_app + click + type_text + click today.
- **Gesture-based scroll** — our scroll uses semantic accessibility actions.
  Views that don't expose ACTION_SCROLL_FORWARD (WebView subframes, some
  custom views) need gesture dispatch. Add when encountered.

## 10. All 10 v1 executors

| Action         | Tier           | Executor              | Self-verifies |
|----------------|----------------|-----------------------|---------------|
| open_app       | INTENT         | OpenAppExecutor       | No (use app_opened verify) |
| home           | ACCESSIBILITY  | HomeExecutor          | No |
| send_sms       | SYSTEM_API     | SendSmsExecutor       | **Yes** (via PendingIntent) |
| make_call      | SYSTEM_API     | MakeCallExecutor      | No |
| send_message   | INTENT         | SendMessageExecutor   | No (user still taps Send) |
| click          | ACCESSIBILITY  | ClickExecutor         | No |
| type_text      | ACCESSIBILITY  | TypeTextExecutor      | **Yes** (read-back match) |
| scroll         | ACCESSIBILITY  | ScrollExecutor        | No |
| wait           | INTENT         | WaitExecutor          | **Yes** (time elapsed) |
| read_screen    | ACCESSIBILITY  | ReadScreenExecutor    | **Yes** (snapshot captured) |